          <li><a href="/pages/about-us" style="font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#d4af37'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(255,255,255,0.65)'">About Us</a></li>
